hange rate.</p><p>Due to changes in the exchange rate happening in real time, the {{currency}} amounts are for reference only.</p>","coupon_rule_v2":"<strong>Explanation of displayed value</strong></br><p>The coupon bundle's value is in {{originCurrency}} and the total value is {{originAmount}} and can be used on qualified orders. {{amount}} is converted based on the {{originCurrency}} to {{currency}} exchange rate. </p><p>Due to changes in the exchange rate happening in real time, the {{currency}} amount is for reference only.</p>","coupon_rule_v3":"The coupon bundle's value is in {{originCurrency}} and the total value is {{originAmount}} and can be used on qualified orders. {{amount}} is converted based on the {{originCurrency}} to {{currency}} exchange rate. Due to changes in the exchange rate happening in real time, the {{currency}} amount is for reference only."}},"n5":{"hot_trends_selling_fast":"Hot Trends Selling Fast","crowdfavorite":"Crowd Favorite","homepage_discover_more_picks":"More picks on homepage","homepage_discover_more_view_now":"View now","explore_more":"Explore More","homepage_discover_more_title":"Didn't find what you like? Discover more on Home.","homepage_discover_more_explore":"Explore <bold>10M+</bold> Products","save_now":"Save Now","cart_push_estimated":"Estimated","join_the_crowd":"Join the Crowd","hot_picks_selling_fast":"Hot Picks Selling Fast","cart_push_title":"Check estimated savings in your cart","best_price_guarantee":"Best Price Guarantee","curve_and_plus":"Curve & Plus","close":"Close","new_surprises_unlocked_v2":"New Surprises Unlocked!","fresh_picks_just_dropped":"Fresh Picks Just Dropped!","found_better_picks_for_you_v2":"Found Better Picks for You!","temu_covers_percent_of_import_charges_trans":"<line1>Temu covers</line1><line2>{{percent}} of import charges</line2>","explore_now_trans":"Explore Now <CountDown />","temu_covers_percent_of_import_charges":"Temu covers {{percent}} of import charges","limited_time_text_6":"Sale Pr